    <body>
      <p style="text-indent: 2em" rend="first-line-indent(2)" source="#source-60-110"><seg source="#source-60-110">……たゞかたくなのみをわぶる</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 4em" rend="first-line-indent(4)" source="#source-110-168"><seg source="#source-110-168">なにをかひとにうらむべき……</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-168-206"><seg source="#source-168-206">ましろきそらにはゞたきて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-206-244"><seg source="#source-206-244">ましろきそらにたゆたひて</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-244-280"><seg source="#source-244-280">百舌はいこひをおもふらし</seg></p>
    </body>
